{"id":"n27778-1-7","stage":5,"title":"최악 · 最坏","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27778-1-7-1","ko":"오늘은 비가 많이 오는 데다가 바람도 많이 불고 파도가 아주 높아요.","zh":"今天不仅雨下得很大，风也很大，海浪还非常高。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"오는","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는","audio":"/audio/204311ae50badf5e3adb.mp3"}},{"text":"데다가","meaning":"再加上、而且","explanation":"-는 데다가：在前一情况的基础上再添加后一情况，这里指雨下得很大，再加上风大、浪高。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"3","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데다가","audio":"/audio/b1c8ca766a4b456c4d2d.mp3"}},{"text":"바람도","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람도","audio":"/audio/fc19fd7fff32f9db707a.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"불고","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불고","audio":"/audio/9476eefcb8be9778146e.mp3"}},{"text":"파도가","meaning":"波涛，浪涛，波浪","explanation":"파도：波涛，浪涛，波浪；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"파도","audio":"/audio/280865cc3d3f77a4628d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71304","senseId":"1","lemma":"파도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파도가","audio":"/audio/0ba2fff2d26aad869848.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"높아요.","meaning":"高","explanation":"높다：高；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"1","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"높아요","audio":"/audio/c3bd3669b00f5a04cfcb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"情况、状况（-는 데다가：在前一情况之外再加上……）","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"情况、状况（-는 데다가：在前一情况之外再加上……）","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]},{"id":"280865cc3d3f77a4","term":"파도","zh":"波涛，浪涛，波浪","audio":"/audio/280865cc3d3f77a4628d.mp3","entryId":"71304","definition":"海上掀起的水波。","pronunciation":["파도"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"5601621a4a648d5b","term":"높다","zh":"高","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3","entryId":"64523","definition":"上下距离较长。","pronunciation":["놉따"]}],"audio":"/audio/927531341bee48eadd2d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27778-1-7-2","ko":"배를 타기에는 최악의 조건이네요.","zh":"这条件简直是最不适合乘船的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배를","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배를","audio":"/audio/8d62500623ac2523536a.mp3"}},{"text":"타기에는","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타기에는","audio":"/audio/fb855bc8a3bdd7c9704c.mp3"}},{"text":"최악의","meaning":"最坏，最差","explanation":"최악：最坏，最差；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"최악","audio":"/audio/03c1eb542ece3e013c34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27778","senseId":"1","lemma":"최악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최악의","audio":"/audio/1a755a92db8188bcda8e.mp3"}},{"text":"조건이네요.","meaning":"条件","explanation":"조건：条件；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"조건","audio":"/audio/291ac97193c19dda0897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91749","senseId":"1","lemma":"조건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조건이네요","audio":"/audio/809958e10852ae275a9d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"船","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"29729","definition":"运载人或东西，在水上行驶的交通工具。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"03c1eb542ece3e01","term":"최악","zh":"最坏，最差","audio":"/audio/03c1eb542ece3e013c34.mp3","entryId":"27778","definition":"在多个中最糟糕。","pronunciation":["최ː악","췌ː악"]},{"id":"291ac97193c19dda","term":"조건","zh":"条件","audio":"/audio/291ac97193c19dda0897.mp3","entryId":"91749","definition":"为做成某事而应该事先具备的状态或要素。","pronunciation":["조껀"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b2fdeea4d651af838be.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.533,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27778","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这条件简直是最不适合乘船的。","今天不仅雨下得很大，风也很大，海浪还非常高。","崔老师发火了，真的好可怕啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天不仅雨下得很大，风也很大，海浪还非常高。","崔老师发火了，真的好可怕啊。","这条件简直是最不适合乘船的。"],"answer":2}]}
